  "question": "The following is a description of an Internet Service Feedback Management System: The system is mainly used for managing user feedback. The system records users' basic information, including user ID, username, contact number, and email. Each feedback has a feedback ID, user ID, feedback content, feedback time, processing status, and processing result. The company has multiple customer service representatives, each with an employee ID, name, contact information, and work status. Each customer service representative can handle multiple feedback items. For each feedback processing, the system needs to record the processing time, processing result, and the processor.",
  "ddl": "-- Schema for database: rschema_0274\nCREATE TABLE `users` (\n  `user_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `username` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `contact_number` varchar(50) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `email` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`user_id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `customer_service_representatives` (\n  `employee_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `contact_information` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `work_status` varchar(50) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`employee_id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `feedback` (\n  `feedback_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `user_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `feedback_content` text NOT NULL,\n  `feedback_time` datetime NOT NULL,\n  `processing_status` varchar(50) NOT NULL,\n  `processing_result` text DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`feedback_id`),\n  KEY `feedback_ibfk_1` (`user_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `feedback_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`user_id`) REFERENCES `users` (`user_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `feedback_processing` (\n  `processing_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `feedback_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `employee_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `processing_time` datetime NOT NULL,\n  `processing_result` text NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`processing_id`),\n  KEY `feedback_processing_ibfk_1` (`feedback_id`),\n  KEY `feedback_processing_ibfk_2` (`employee_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `feedback_processing_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`feedback_id`) REFERENCES `feedback` (`feedback_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `feedback_processing_ibfk_2` FOREIGN KEY (`employee_id`) REFERENCES `customer_service_representatives` (`employee_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;",
